spice
* Example SPICE Netlist

V1 2 0 DC V_in ; Voltage source from node 2 to ground
F1 4 0 V1 gm ; Current source controlled by V_in (g_m represents transconductance)
R1 2 3 RD ; Resistor connected between node 2 and node 3 (R_D represents resistance)
C1 3 0 CL ; Capacitor connected between node 3 and ground (C_L represents capacitance)
